WEBVTT

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.220
Kyoko, pass the salt,
will you?

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:44.360
Did you hear me, Kyoko?!

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:00.830
It's your fault for
going to the Mr. Otonashi

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:02.890
and telling him that
she quit her job as manager.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.950
What's wrong with that?

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.980
She's abandoned her job
for a week already.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.560
She should be
fired for that.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:21.060
Kyoko, it's okay.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.650
I'm grateful that
you've lasted this long.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:30.410
Anyway, I've already
hired a new manager,

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:32.480
although he's
a temporary one.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.000
That gang would never
accept a new manager.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.690
Only I am capable
of that job.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.350
Gimme a break!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.130
I'll never have time to go
get Manager at this rate.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.690
By the way, I hope you
broke it off with Kozue.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.620
Wh-What do you mean?

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.060
Unless you do,

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.820
it's no use trying
to get back the manager.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.250
It's futile!

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:15.320
Or why don't you just
get together with Kozue?

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.820
Now that you've successfully
landed a steady job.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.500
Don't mock me!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.780
Anyway, stop partying here!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:27.780
Geez!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.320
What'll I do?

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:49.900
I can't just show up
at Maison Ikkoku.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:56.350
So Godai's the
acting manager?

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.680
And he's using his position

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.100
to prohibit partying
in the hallway.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:03.250
What an unreasonable man.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.260
Welcome!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.280
Hi.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:10.980
Manager?!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.550
Wh-What's everyone
doing here?

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.260
It's you!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.420
The nerve of you
to show up here,

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.280
after all the trouble

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.330
Please, Akemi.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.930
Don't make her feel bad.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.510
To make amends, she says
she'll pick up our tab.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.970
Right, Manager?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.010
I never said such a thing.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:34.950
Boo.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.090
So? What're you going to do?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.850
You're not gonna
quit, are you?

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.950
I don't intend to.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.200
But.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:50.530
But you're waiting for Godai
to end things with Kozue?

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.600
That'll take another
hundred years.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.660
Here's your coffee.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:02.400
They might get together
while you stay away.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.360
If that's the case,
so be it.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:11.610
Really? Then maybe
I'll seduce him.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.260
Did you hear that,
Mrs. Ichinose?!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.850
That was a very
interesting statement

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.050
Lately, I'm starting
to want more

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.680
than just sleeping
next to him.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.710
You mind?

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.770
I'm gonna.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.410
If that's the case,
so be it.

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:44.280
You don't care?
Then I'm gonna seduce him.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.240
Be my guest!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.780
Good-bye.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.660
350 yen.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:05:59.900
- Your change!
- Keep it.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:00.850
Hey!

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.430
Why don't you stop by
Maison Ikkoku on your way home

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.350
and say hello to
the new manager?

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.170
That's what I plan to do.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.030
Unfortunately for
the new manager,

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.930
I'm not planning to return
to work for a long time.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:17.410
Come again!

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:24.180
I had no idea you had
feelings for Godai, Akemi.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.180
Please! It's a joke.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:28.530
It doesn't sound like a joke

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.650
when it comes out
of your mouth.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.570
It's okay.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.980
If I don't scare her like that,
she'll never come back.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.730
Such a drag.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.910
If she wants to
seduce him, let her.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.510
If he's one to fall
for her, then...

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.520
He might fall for it.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.410
He is faint-hearted, after all...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.100
Why is Godai sweeping?

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.290
Manager?

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:20.030
Manager, the bathroom lock
is broken.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:23.580
All right, but stop
calling me Manager.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.510
But you are the manager.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.950
He's the new manager?

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.280
Manager, phone.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:38.350
I can hear that!
I'm busy, you know.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.730
I didn't need to panic.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:50.970
I'm going home.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:01.530
Where's the heck is Akemi?

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.820
She said she has a date.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.330
Date? With whom?

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:07.980
I do not know.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.050
Could it be Godai?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:16.200
Maybe she wasn't kidding.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.220
I'm sure she was joking.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:22.930
It's just that Akemi
sometimes carries out her joke.

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:26.210
It's entirely possible.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.640
Thanks for holding.
This is Godai.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.460
Akemi?

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.020
I'm in your neighborhood.
Guess where?

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.050
Are you drunk?

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.190
Can you bring some money
to the address

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.240
I'm gonna give you?

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:47.730
Money? You must be joking.
I'm working right now.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.120
Fine! I'm going
to kill myself!

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:57.070
Are you crying?
Hello? Akemi?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.450
I'm so busy!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:09.380
Turn this corner, and
it's the second building.

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:24.300
It's a love hotel?
The address is right.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.060
What's she doing here?

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.130
Are you here to see
the guest in room 302?

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:34.630
Well, yes.
She's an acquaintance.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:37.210
She's waiting for you.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.470
O-Oh.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.710
The elevator is that way.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:41.970
T-Thank you.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:48.120
What's going on?

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:53.120
D-Did she just
lure me here...?

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:15.090
Akemi?

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.870
Akemi? I'm here.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.610
It's open.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.690
Akemi?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:38.100
A-Akemi! Hey! Get up!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:41.900
Akemi! Hey!

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:43.130
Hey!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.010
H-Hey!

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.270
Hey!

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:54.350
P-Please...A-Akemi.!

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:00.960
Huh?

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.920
What do you think
you're doing?!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.490
Why the hell are you here?!

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.760
You called me here!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:12.320
I called you? Why?

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.820
That's what I want to know.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.970
Sorry!

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:23.610
The guy I was with left after
I've had too much to drink.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.000
Look how much I drank!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.650
Let's go home.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.720
What's the dilemma?

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.920
You should marry the man
with a reliable income.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.860
Why live a hard life?

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:41.390
But if I'm not with him,
Godai might-

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:46.080
A loser will always be a
loser no matter who he's with.

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.180
You think so?

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.100
Definitely

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.810
What're you doing?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.150
This is bad.
Someone might see us.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.820
You'd never run into someone
you know around here.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.320
Oh, good evening!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.330
Oh, good evening!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.440
Kozue...?

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.200
You know them, Kozue?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.100
I don't know them.
Let's go.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:02.060
She must be hurt.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.610
Morning!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.250
How are you? Invigorated?

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.690
Why would I feel invigorated?

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:14.460
Why not? You were able
to cut Kozue out of your life.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.170
Really?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.800
She dumped him good.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.990
Isn't that great?!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:24.100
How'd you do it?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.010
Easy. She saw me and-

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.050
Akemi!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.100
- What?
- Come here!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:32.900
So what if she finds out?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.080
It's not something
you tell people.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.580
What are you panicking about?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.090
I'm not panicking.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.960
Did something happen
between you two?

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.650
Absolutely nothing.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:47.930
I would have been impressed
if something had happened.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.840
You better be grateful

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:53.100
You have me to thank
for ending it.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:05.090
But that was a
bad way to end it.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.980
Hello? This is Godai.
Is Kozue-

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:17.090
Kozue? Are you listening?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.460
I want to see you

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:22.560
to explain about last night
and some other things.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.490
Kozue?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.440
Kozue, who was that for?

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:36.040
Wrong number.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.790
You're trying to
patch things up?

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.880
Since when have you
been standing there?!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.730
I heard everything
from Akemi.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.790
Leave it alone.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:55.380
After you explain yourself,

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.760
you have to talk about
breaking up anyway.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.440
Yes, but.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:04.180
"I want her to remember me as
a special man in her life,

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.860
"even after I break up with her..."

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.600
That's just selfish.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:11.820
No.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:13.420
No.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.980
Idiot.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.080
Soichiro.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.990
I'm home.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:30.970
Kyoko, someone from Maison Ikkoku's
been waiting for you.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.550
Hey! How are you?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.340
Oh, it's you, Mrs. Ichinose.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.000
Sorry I'm not Godai.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.840
I didn't mean that.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.010
They broke up?

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.850
Yes. Completely.

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.480
So.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.890
isn't it time you come back?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.540
But.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.470
It's what you wanted, isn't it?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.040
No.  I never--

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:15.170
But hadn't he proposed to Kozue?

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:16.940
So.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:20.640
Misunderstanding.
Just a misunderstanding.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.970
No one told me that.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.080
You wouldn't listen.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:35.560
Besides, Godai's a crude
and careless manager.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.760
I can have Godai come
and pick you up tomorrow.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.340
No, I can go-

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.540
I can go back.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:46.970
on my own.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.690
Great

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.150
I hope you're taking
the dog with you.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:04.180
Why would I leave him here?

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.620
Yes, yes.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:30.260
I wonder if Godai
told Kozue about me?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.990
So.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:39.130
Manager will be
returning tomorrow!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.620
So now she understands?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:49.870
Don't you dare try
to talk to Kozue again.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:52.310
After all, it's
true that you and I...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.050
came out of the love hotel.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.900
Love...love hotel?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.320
Godai, I'm envious!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.110
We only came out!
That's it!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.560
You came out
because you went in.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.790
Actually, when I woke up,
you were on top of me.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:12.560
Did you do something to me?

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.570
Of course not!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:18.570
If you're telling me
the truth, look into my eyes.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.010
How dare you return
evil for good!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.540
W-What're you doing?!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:27.540
I saw that

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:28.630
I saw that, too!!

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:30.510
Token of my appreciation.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.400
Pay me back for
the hotel bill!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.520
How dare you make
a woman pay for the hotel?!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.940
These two have a thing going.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:37.710
Yes!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:38.780
Listen!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.120
Manager's coming home
tomorrow, and now this.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.850
You have no faith in me?

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:51.430
I'm joking. I know
you don't have the guts.

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:55.040
You better go
easy on him, Akemi.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.570
It's a joke!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:00.570
It's so much fun
to pick on Godai.

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:02.390
Anyway, let's
celebrate in advance

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.600
the return of the manager!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.350
Cheers!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.150
'Morning, Manager!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.450
Hey!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:32.360
I know! You're going
to be fired today.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:33.640
Geez.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.960
It's backed up from
the railway crossing.

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:03.860
May I get off here?
We're very close.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:07.440
It might be faster.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.910
Kozue?

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:30.620
Hello.

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:32.630
Hello.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.120
Traveling?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.110
Sort of.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:46.110
Bye.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:48.280
Umm..

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.260
Umm..

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.940
May I talk to you?

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:24.330
I didn't know...Godai was
in love with someone.

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:28.490
I had no idea.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:33.190
Godai did tell her about me.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:43.740
I don't know what to say.

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:51.370
It's okay. I was shocked,
but now I know what to do.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:58.760
Please tell him that
I won't see him anymore.

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:21.710
I have my own.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:31.140
I'm so dense.

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:38.850
Godai's so nice, I assumed
he had feelings for me.

00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:49.630
It never occurred to me that
he had a woman like that.

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:50.540
Huh?

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:54.080
I'm such an idiot!

00:22:55.380 --> 00:22:58.610
"A woman like that"?

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:03.490
Akemi at Maison Ikkoku.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:04.680
What?

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:06.680
No way.

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:11.570
I saw them! I saw them
coming out of a hotel!

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.570
She's late.

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:23.040
Maybe she's shopping.

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:26.080
Is she really coming back?

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:53.200
Coward! Lowlife! Wimp!
Two-timer! Scum!

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:56.060
So they've made up.

00:23:56.190 --> 00:23:59.150
But that always-surprising Kozue.

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:00.450
Marriage?

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:04.300
